<title>HONG KONG: Shinhan Bank to set US$150 mln 144a sub bond.</title>
<headline>Shinhan Bank to set US$150 mln 144a sub bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shinhan Bank has verbally mandated Merrill Lynch and SBC Warburg to arrange a US$150 million 144a subordinated bond, sources close to the transaction said.</p>
<p>The five-year facility has no put or call options, they said, declining to give details on pricing.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
